[USER, PASSWORD]

AuthSystem
-----------
users: ℙ USER
passwords: USER ↔ PASSWORD

∀ u: USER • (u ∈ users ⇒ ∃ p: PASSWORD • (u, p) ∈ passwords)


Signup
-----------
ΔAuthSystem
user?: USER
pass?: PASSWORD

user? ∉ users

users' = users ∪ {user?}
passwords' = passwords ∪ {(user?, pass?)}


Login
-----------
ΞAuthSystem
user?: USER
pass?: PASSWORD
success!: BOOL

(user? ∈ users ∧ (user?, pass?) ∈ passwords)
⇒ success! = TRUE

¬(user? ∈ users ∧ (user?, pass?) ∉ passwords)
⇒ success! = FALSE


UserAlreadyExists
-----------
ΞAuthSystem
user?: USER

user? ∈ users


InvalidLogin
-----------
ΞAuthSystem
user?: USER
pass?: PASSWORD

(user? ∉ users ∨ (user?, pass?) ∉ passwords)